Alias-template default argument reading an inherited static through a
decltype base chain fails to evaluate inside namespace std; the member
using it in its return type is dropped and resolution sees only the
free same-named function template.  Blocks dog-fooding
remove_const_function_pointers.cpp (unordered_set::insert).
